Nostr City

This project includes modified code derived from ProbableTrain/MapGenerator:

  https://github.com/ProbableTrain/MapGenerator

The upstream project was created by Keir (ProbableTrain) and contributors and is licensed under LGPL-3.0-only. Nostr City preserves the original license terms through COPYING and COPYING.LESSER.

Nostr City has been substantially modified from the upstream project. Changes include, but are not limited to, Nostr integration, a React overlay, Fastify Backend-for-Frontend services, VitePress documentation, i18n, updated tests, public site work, and project-specific branding.

The CSS colour parser embedded in src/ts/util.ts carries its own MIT-style notice from Dean McNamee. Keep that notice intact when redistributing source code.
